<section class="page-hero" style="padding-bottom:24px"><div class="wrap wrap-narrow"><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="ledger"></span>Security policy</p><h1>Security</h1></div></section>
<section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0"><div class="wrap wrap-narrow">
  <div class="less"><ol><li class="h1"># Security</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## disclosure</li><li class="p">Report vulnerabilities to security@projectxprotocol.dev.</li><li class="p">Acknowledgement within 24 hours.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## scope</li><li class="p">All packages listed on the on-chain page. Web front ends at</li><li class="p">projectxprotocol.dev and weir.social.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## safe harbor</li><li class="p">Good-faith research on the listed scope is authorised. No legal action</li><li class="p">taken against researchers acting in good faith.</li><li>&nbsp;</li><li class="h2">## rewards</li><li class="p">Case-by-case. Critical fund-loss reports have paid up to $50,000.</li><li>&nbsp;</li></ol><span class="end">(END)</span><div class="mod">// last-modified 2026-09-21</div></div>
</div></section>
